  static long Num(JToken o,string key,long max){Need(o[key]!=null&&o[key].Type==JTokenType.Integer,"Required integer "+key);long n=(long)o[key];Need(n>=0&&n<=max,"Integer domain "+key);return n;}
  internal static InitialWorldEnvelope Read(string path,string expectedHash){Need(System.IO.Path.IsPathRooted(path)&&expectedHash!=null&&expectedHash.Length==64&&expectedHash.All(c=>c>='0'&&c<='9'||c>='a'&&c<='f'),"Absolute initial bundle plus exact SHA required");byte[] bytes=ExactInitialValueCodec.ReadFile(path,268435456);Need(ExactInitialValueCodec.Hash(bytes)==expectedHash,"Initial bundle hash mismatch");JObject doc;
   using(var text=new StringReader(new UTF8Encoding(false,true).GetString(bytes)))using(var reader=new JsonTextReader(text){MaxDepth=96,DateParseHandling=DateParseHandling.None,FloatParseHandling=FloatParseHandling.Double}){doc=JObject.Load(reader,new JsonLoadSettings{DuplicatePropertyNameHandling=DuplicatePropertyNameHandling.Error,LineInfoHandling=LineInfoHandling.Ignore});Need(!reader.Read(),"Trailing initial JSON");}
   var top=new HashSet<string>(new[]{"schema_version","kind","source_authority","boundary","world","systems","scheduler","startup_observation","artifacts","closure"});Need(doc.Properties().All(p=>top.Contains(p.Name))&&doc.Count==top.Count&&Num(doc,"schema_version",1)==1&&Str(doc,"kind")=="InitialGroundWorldBundle","Exact initial envelope revision");
   var boundary=Obj(doc,"boundary");Need(Str(boundary,"phase")=="InitializationSystemGroup.AfterSkirmishRosterProjection.BeforeSimulation"&&Flag(boundary,"valid")&&Flag(boundary,"original_structural_sync_observed")&&Num(boundary,"simulation_entries_after_spawn",0)==0,"Original post-roster pre-consumer boundary");Need(Num(boundary,"roster_entity_order_before",int.MaxValue)!=Num(boundary,"roster_entity_order_after",int.MaxValue),"Actual roster structural order change required");Num(boundary,"engine_frame",int.MaxValue);var session=ExactInitialValueCodec.EntityId(Str(boundary,"session_entity"));Need(session!=Entity.Null&&!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Str(boundary,"session_id")),"Initial session identity");
   var closure=Obj(doc,"closure");Need(!Flag(closure,"complete")&&Flag(closure,"capture_complete")&&!Flag(closure,"autonomous_qualified")&&!Flag(closure,"future_native_inputs")&&Arr(closure,"capture_missing").Count==0&&Arr(closure,"missing").Count==0,"Exporter capture completeness is required and is not consumer admission");var requirements=Arr(closure,"consumer_requirements").Select(t=>(string)t).ToArray();Need(requirements.Length==3&&requirements.Distinct().Count()==3&&requirements.Contains("compiled_read_domain")&&requirements.Contains("logical_identity_policy")&&requirements.Contains("scheduler_backend"),"Exact independent consumer requirements");
   var authority=Obj(doc,"source_authority");Need(Obj(authority,"source_pins").Count>0&&Obj(authority,"loaded_assemblies").Count>0&&Str(authority,"manifest_sha256").Length==64,"Native owning source/image pins required");
   var world=Obj(doc,"world");Need(Flag(world,"census_complete")&&!Flag(world,"authority_closure_complete")&&!Flag(world,"query_order_authority")&&Str(world,"byte_order")=="little-endian"&&Str(world,"boundary_precondition")=="caller_already_synchronized_no_pending_jobs","Exact global census scope");Num(world,"global_system_version",uint.MaxValue);Num(world,"entity_order_version",int.MaxValue);var entities=Arr(world,"entities");Need(entities.Count>0&&entities.Count<=131072,"Entity census bound");var schemas=Obj(world,"type_schema");Need(schemas.Count>0&&schemas.Count<=16384,"Type schema bound");var types=new Dictionary<string,JObject>(StringComparer.Ordinal);foreach(var p in schemas.Properties()){Need(p.Value is JObject,"Type schema shape");types.Add(p.Name,(JObject)p.Value);}
   var records=new Dictionary<Entity,JObject>();var order=new List<Entity>();var chunks=new Dictionary<long,List<int>>();foreach(JObject record in entities){var entity=ExactInitialValueCodec.EntityId(Str(record,"id"));Need(entity!=Entity.Null&&!records.ContainsKey(entity),"Unique nonnull captured entity");records.Add(entity,record);order.Add(entity);long chunk=Num(record,"chunk_ordinal",131071);int index=(int)Num(record,"index_in_chunk",131071);if(!chunks.TryGetValue(chunk,out var indices)){indices=new List<int>();chunks.Add(chunk,indices);}Need(index==indices.Count,"Original ordered contiguous chunk rows");indices.Add(index);var components=Obj(record,"components");Need(components.Count<=1024,"Per-entity component bound");foreach(var component in components.Properties()){Need(types.ContainsKey(component.Name)&&component.Value is JObject,"Component schema binding");var value=(JObject)component.Value;Need(Flag(value,"present"),"No invented absent component rows");Num(value,"change_version",uint.MaxValue);Need(Str(value,"type_hash")==Str(types[component.Name],"stable_type_hash"),"Native component stable type hash mismatch");Need(Flag(value,"chunk_component")==Flag(types[component.Name],"chunk_component"),"Chunk component flag");bool enableable=Flag(types[component.Name],"enableable");Need(enableable?value["enabled"]!=null&&value["enabled"].Type==JTokenType.Boolean:value["enabled"]!=null&&value["enabled"].Type==JTokenType.Null,"Exact enablement presence");Need(value["value"]is JObject,"Typed component value");}
    Need(Flag(record,"prefab")==components.ContainsKey("Unity.Entities.Prefab")&&Flag(record,"disabled")==components.ContainsKey("Unity.Entities.Disabled")&&Flag(record,"system")==components.ContainsKey("Unity.Entities.SystemInstance")&&Flag(record,"meta_chunk")==components.ContainsKey("Unity.Entities.ChunkHeader"),"Census tag facts must match actual components");
   }
   Need(records.ContainsKey(session),"Session outside census");foreach(JObject reference in Arr(world,"reference_map")){var entity=ExactInitialValueCodec.EntityId(Str(reference,"id"));Need(Flag(reference,"in_census")&&(entity==Entity.Null||records.ContainsKey(entity)),"Entity reference closure");Str(reference,"path");}
   var counts=Obj(world,"counts");Need(Num(counts,"entities",131072)==entities.Count&&Num(counts,"chunks",131072)==chunks.Count&&Num(counts,"types",16384)==types.Count,"Actual census counts");Num(counts,"value_nodes",2000000);Num(counts,"binary_bytes",268435456);Obj(doc,"systems");Obj(doc,"scheduler");Obj(doc,"artifacts");
   var startup=Obj(doc,"startup_observation");Need(Str(startup,"path")=="startup-observation.json"&&Num(startup,"engine_frame",int.MaxValue)==Num(boundary,"engine_frame",int.MaxValue)&&Str(startup,"session_id")==Str(boundary,"session_id"),"Same-boundary startup member");byte[] member=ExactInitialValueCodec.ReadFile(System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(path),"startup-observation.json"),268435456);Need(member.LongLength==Num(startup,"bytes",268435456)&&ExactInitialValueCodec.Hash(member)==Str(startup,"sha256"),"Startup member hash/size");
   return new InitialWorldEnvelope(path,expectedHash,doc,session,order.ToArray(),records,types);
  }
  internal JObject PendingConsumerAdmission(string buildHash,string runtimeHash,string sourceEpoch){return new JObject{["status"]="PendingConsumerAdmission",["bundle_sha256"]=Hash,["worker_build_sha256"]=buildHash,["runtime_sha256"]=runtimeHash,["source_epoch"]=sourceEpoch,["capture_complete"]=true,["consumer_requirements"]=Document["closure"]["consumer_requirements"].DeepClone(),["compiled_read_domain"]=new JObject{["complete"]=false,["missing"]=new JArray("typed component/native ABI bindings and all executed owner read domains")},["logical_identity_policy"]=new JObject{["complete"]=false,["initial_ids_preserved"]=true,["native_future_allocator_proven"]=false},["scheduler_backend"]=new JObject{["complete"]=false,["profile"]="owned fixed virtual clock / original source lifecycle",["native_future_query_order_proven"]=false},["admitted"]=false};}
 }
